## 3. Claim type mapping

| Signal                                          | `ClaimType`              |
|-------------------------------------------------|--------------------------|
| Any tweet mentioning the target                 | `SOCIAL_POST`            |
| Tweet contains breach/leak keywords             | `CREDENTIAL_EXPOSURE`    |
| Tweet contains 3+ hashtags                      | `HASHTAG_ACTIVITY`       |
| Tweet has media attachments                     | `MEDIA_MENTION`          |
| Mapped interactions between accounts            | `ACCOUNT_NETWORK`        |

