## 5. Raw query builder

When templates don't fit, use `TwitterQueryBuilder` directly.
All methods are fluent (chainable). Build returns a string.

```python
q = (
    TwitterQueryBuilder()
    .exact_phrase("nginx data breach")
    .none_of("movie", "game")
    .hashtag("infosec")
    .min_likes(50)
    .exclude_retweets()
    .since("2024-01-01")
    .build()
)
# → '"nginx data breach" -movie -game #infosec min_faves:50 -is:retweet since:2024-01-01'
```

