## 6. API tier selection

| Access tier              | Endpoint                        | Date range | Rate limit          |
|--------------------------|--------------------------------|------------|---------------------|
| Free (bearer token)      | `/tweets/search/recent`        | Last 7 days | 1 req / 15 min     |
| Basic / Pro              | `/tweets/search/recent`        | Last 7 days | Higher              |
| Academic / Enterprise    | `/tweets/search/all`           | Since 2006  | 1 request / 1s      |

Set `full_archive: True` only when the target requires historical data pre-7 days.
Default to `full_archive: False` unless the analyst explicitly enables it.

