## 9. FastAPI registration

Register the endpoint in `src/api/main.py`:

```python
from src.tools.twitter_tool import TwitterInput, TwitterOutput, twitter_search_endpoint

@app.post("/api/v1/tools/twitter", response_model=TwitterOutput)
async def twitter_search(inp: TwitterInput) -> TwitterOutput:
    return await twitter_search_endpoint(inp)
```
